              <groupfilter function='member' level='[:Measure Names]' member='&quot;[federated.10x6wjm0mkx7aj1dgcrt31jyjlun].[usr:conversion rate- qd- 1st meeting (copy) (copy)_6835549447276474404:qk]&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
